    {
      "id": "prepare-gemini-analysis-request",
      "name": "Prepare Gemini Analysis Request",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "position": [
        1664,
        -112
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "const cfg = $('Set Source Reel And Target Product').first().json;\nconst scenes = $('Split Detected Scenes').all().map(i => i.json);\nconst parts = [];\nparts.push({ text: [\n  'You are a shot-list analyst. The attached still frames are ONE frame per detected scene cut of a short-form video, given in order.',\n  '',\n  'Scene timings:',\n  scenes.map(s => 'Scene ' + (s.index + 1) + ': ' + s.startSeconds + 's to ' + s.endSeconds + 's (' + s.durationSeconds + 's)').join('\\n'),\n  '',\n  'For EACH scene, read its frame and report shot_size, camera_angle, camera_movement (infer from framing, blur and subject position) and composition (subject placement, framing, lighting, background, colour palette).',\n  '',\n  'Then write two prompts per scene that recreate THAT EXACT SHOT but replace the subject or product with: \"' + cfg.target_product + '\".',\n  '- image_prompt: a still-image prompt reproducing the same shot size, angle, framing, lighting and colour palette, featuring the replacement product.',\n  '- motion_prompt: a short camera and subject motion instruction matching this scene movement, to animate that still for its exact duration.',\n  '',\n  'Return exactly ' + scenes.length + ' scenes, in order. Do not merge, split or invent scenes.'\n].join('\\n') });\nfor (let i = 0; i < scenes.length; i++) {\n  const buf = await this.helpers.getBinaryDataBuffer(i, 'data');\n  parts.push({ text: '--- Scene ' + (scenes[i].index + 1) + ' frame (' + scenes[i].durationSeconds + 's) ---' });\n  parts.push({ inline_data: { mime_type: 'image/jpeg', data: buf.toString('base64') } });\n}\nconst responseSchema = { type:'OBJECT', properties:{ scenes:{ type:'ARRAY', items:{ type:'OBJECT', properties:{\n  scene_index:{type:'INTEGER'}, shot_size:{type:'STRING'}, camera_angle:{type:'STRING'},\n  camera_movement:{type:'STRING'}, composition:{type:'STRING'}, image_prompt:{type:'STRING'}, motion_prompt:{type:'STRING'}\n}, required:['scene_index','shot_size','camera_angle','camera_movement','composition','image_prompt','motion_prompt'] } } }, required:['scenes'] };\nreturn [{ json: { body: { contents:[{ parts }], generationConfig:{ responseMimeType:'application/json', responseSchema, temperature:0.4 } } } }];"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "analyse-shots-with-gemini-flash",
      "name": "Analyse Shots With Gemini Flash",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "notes": "Model pinned on purpose. The gemini-flash-latest alias tracks the newest Flash, which carries the tightest free-tier quota and the heaviest load.",
      "maxTries": 5,
